{"title":"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is added to the square of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> the result is divisible by\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/9/f89f9373f2ec2e5c118bc4cd5d2ac00d9e8c3582.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 5 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 23 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"406\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, the square of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1cb2b1216f6a5a6e9672c52b9cbe9349231f450.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{2} = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />. Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to that would give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/e/ade510ca67677e9ac30af3fc8b03cdc551a681c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25 + 8 = 33$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>We can also notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/9/5792d5cf918fad2dc026ee139364efa584db8a85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33 = 3 \\times 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />. From the answer choices, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6f3bccae16d5e31266370fced24edc41538d5da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/c/dfc1f49dce8a822c719603dab4c2e631a317af71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley\">1999 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" 